# The queue in front of Cafe Zauner (Bad Ischl; the M7 boss, foreshadowed),
# back layer, decoration only (no hitbox), no k: seven guests at the walkers'
# scale facing left towards the cafe door, edges in each material's darkest
# shade: a man in Lederhosen O/l with a G Tyrolean hat (w feather) who
# checks his phone in frame 1 (d phone, s screen), a lady in a green G/j
# Dirndl with a p/E apron and a brown bun, a tourist in a Y/o straw sun hat
# and p/E shirt who shifts her weight in frame 1, a dad (S/b shirt) with a
# child (Y/o shirt, G cap) on his shoulders, a selfie tourist (i hat, t/T
# shirt) with an m selfie stick and a d phone held high (it tilts in frame
# 1), an old lady (w/i hair, c/o cardigan, B/b skirt, R handbag) and a
# backpacker (S/b cap, y/g shirt, O/l backpack).
# Placement: 112x32, origin 56,32 (bottom on the square), idle 2f/30t.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids are the source.
sprite = warteschlange
size   = 112x32
origin = 56,32
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=30 loop
